  "solution": "According to the given information,\n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n M\n N\n O\n \n \n\n **Sign**\n +\n +\n ÷\n \n \n\nLet's check,\n\n**17 M 18 N 55 O 5 = 46**\n\n→ 17 + 18 + **55 ****÷ 5** = 46\n\n→ 17 + 18 + 11 = 46\n\n**68 M 13 N 65 O 13 = 86**\n\n→ 68 + 13 + **65 ÷ 13** = 86\n\n→ 68 + 13 + 5 = 86\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**40 M 70 N 85 O 17 = ?**\n\n→ 40 + 70 + **85 ÷ 17** = ?\n\n→ 40 + 70 + 5 = 115\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"115\"**.",
